Package: bodsr2
Title: Call the Bus Open Data Service (BODS) API Through R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Nancy", "Pickering", , "your@email.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A wrapper to call the Bus Open Data Service BODS API using httr2. Provides functions to retrieve real-time vehicle location data in SIRI-VM and GTFS-RT formats, timetable and fare metadata, and utilities for parsing responses into tidy data frames.
